1
00:00:00,144 --> 00:00:05,987
Part 10 mein sales order ka poora safar: order book karna, chemist chunna,

2
00:00:05,987 --> 00:00:12,777
products aur quantity, special rate aur scheme, stock aur credit check, approve karna,

3
00:00:12,777 --> 00:00:15,620
reject karna aur status track karna.

4
00:00:16,565 --> 00:00:23,462
Orders screen par saare orders hain: portal, salesman, phone aur office se aaye.

5
00:00:23,462 --> 00:00:31,565
Upar filters hain: Open, Awaiting approval, Approved, Picking, Packed, Invoiced aur Delivered.

6
00:00:31,565 --> 00:00:37,945
Har order mein source, value, credit status aur current status dikhta hai.

7
00:00:38,613 --> 00:00:40,595
Naya order banate hain.

8
00:00:40,595 --> 00:00:42,232
Book order dabaiye.

9
00:00:42,232 --> 00:00:48,263
Chemist list mein filter kariye aur Lalpur Life Care Pharmacy chuniye.

10
00:00:48,263 --> 00:00:53,777
Turant uski credit limit, balance aur price tier dikh jaata hai.

11
00:00:54,432 --> 00:00:59,621
Add product box mein do akshar likhiye aur Enter dabaiye.

12
00:00:59,621 --> 00:01:01,351
Pantovista 40 joda.

13
00:01:01,351 --> 00:01:07,269
Is chemist ke liye Pantovista ka special rate 110 rupaye set hai,

14
00:01:07,269 --> 00:01:10,364
isliye rate PTR ki jagah 110 aaya.

15
00:01:11,029 --> 00:01:13,403
Ab Febrinil 650, 30 packs.

16
00:01:13,403 --> 00:01:21,713
Febrinil par 10 plus 2 scheme chal raha hai, toh Free column mein 6 packs apne-aap aa gaye.

17
00:01:21,713 --> 00:01:27,009
Scheme yaad rakhne ya calculator chalane ki zaroorat nahi.

18
00:01:27,661 --> 00:01:30,810
Teesra product Calvita D3, 10 packs.

19
00:01:30,810 --> 00:01:38,683
Prana company par extra 5 percent discount scheme hai, woh Disc column mein dikh raha hai.

20
00:01:38,683 --> 00:01:42,969
Stock column batata hai kitna maal available hai.

21
00:01:43,621 --> 00:01:50,781
Daayi taraf taxable value, discount, CGST aur SGST, round off aur total.

22
00:01:50,781 --> 00:01:55,058
Warehouse ke liye note bhi likh sakte hain.

23
00:01:55,058 --> 00:01:57,345
Ab Place order dabaiye.

24
00:01:58,010 --> 00:02:02,181
Order place ho gaya aur Awaiting approval mein hai.

25
00:02:02,181 --> 00:02:05,944
Credit theek hai, isliye credit status OK hai.

26
00:02:05,944 --> 00:02:09,379
Order kholte hain aur Approve dabate hain.

27
00:02:09,379 --> 00:02:14,614
Stock batch-wise reserve hua aur pick list godown ko chali gayi.

28
00:02:15,268 --> 00:02:17,757
Ab ek order reject karte hain.

29
00:02:17,757 --> 00:02:21,821
Kanke Road Medical Store ka portal order kholiye.

30
00:02:21,821 --> 00:02:26,799
Maan lijiye chemist ne phone par order cancel karne ko kaha.

31
00:02:26,799 --> 00:02:29,619
Reject dabaiye aur reason likhiye.

32
00:02:29,619 --> 00:02:35,592
Reject hua order kabhi bill nahi hota, aur reason record mein rehta hai.

33
00:02:36,252 --> 00:02:40,127
Approve hone se pehle order cancel bhi ho sakta hai,

34
00:02:40,127 --> 00:02:45,864
aur zaroorat ho toh line-wise quantity kam karke dobara order liya jaata hai.

35
00:02:45,864 --> 00:02:49,814
Approve hone ke baad stock reserve ho chuka hota hai,

36
00:02:49,814 --> 00:02:53,912
isliye badlaav ke liye cancel karke naya order banaiye.

37
00:02:54,564 --> 00:03:01,465
Har order ka status timeline mein dikhta hai: Awaiting approval, Approved, Picking, Packed,

38
00:03:01,465 --> 00:03:04,575
Invoiced, Out for delivery aur Delivered.

39
00:03:04,575 --> 00:03:09,656
Office ko kabhi phone karke poochhna nahi padta ki order kahan hai.

40
00:03:10,307 --> 00:03:14,068
Credit control order ka sabse zaroori hissa hai.

41
00:03:14,068 --> 00:03:21,199
Agla part poori tarah isi par hai: limit cross karne wale chemist ke order ka kya hota hai.
